### Docker host (default)
#@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Local dotnet run host example
@WebApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7280
@ContentType = application/json

### Login Doctor
# @name loginDoctor
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

{
	"NIN": "123456789",
	"password": "AdminPass123!"
}

### Doctor token from previous response
@doctorAccessToken = {{loginDoctor.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Login Patient
# @name loginPatient
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{ContentType}}

{
	"NIN": "987654321",
	"password": "PatientPass123!"
}

### Patient token from previous response
@patientAccessToken = {{loginPatient.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Get current user (Bearer required)
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorAccessToken}}

### Doctor-only endpoint (Bearer + Doctor role required)
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/doctor-only
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorAccessToken}}

### Doctor-only endpoint with patient token (expected 403)
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/doctor-only
Authorization: Bearer {{patientAccessToken}}
